{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_215_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"一、二年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_215_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，壬辰，雉門及兩觀災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_215_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"其不曰雉門災及兩觀何也？災自兩觀始也，不以尊者親災也。先言雉門，尊尊也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_215_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人伐吳。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_215_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"四、冬，十月，新作雉門及兩觀。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_215_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_215","textTraditional":"言新，有舊也。作，為也，有加度也，此不正。其以尊者親之何也？雖不正也，於美猶可也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}